    "text": "These edges are directed (from, to). What does the program print for the in-degrees?",
    "code": "import java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        int[][] e = {{0, 1}, {0, 2}, {2, 1}, {3, 1}};\n        int[] in = new int[4];\n        for (int[] x : e) in[x[1]]++;\n        System.out.println(Arrays.toString(in));\n    }\n}\n",
